{{!--
Todo triage prompt. This file belongs to the repository after installation.

Available variables:
- epicNumber: EPIC issue whose Todo tasks should be triaged
- triageSkill: triage skill configured by the EPIC
- epicTriagePrompt: additional triage instructions from the EPIC
- resultPath: path where the triage result must be saved
--}}
/octestra
Follow the `triage` phase contract.
Use the `{{triageSkill}}` skill to triage the Todo tasks belonging to EPIC #{{epicNumber}}.

{{#if epicTriagePrompt}}
Additional instructions from the EPIC:

{{epicTriagePrompt}}
{{/if}}

The triage skill decides which tasks to inspect, how many to select, what makes a task ready, and
which issue preparation changes are required. Follow it instead of inventing triage policy in this
prompt. Do not change the `AI Task Status` Issue Field directly. Report only tasks whose preparation
completed successfully. Write and check the triage result at `{{resultPath}}` as required by
/octestra.
